# The hand-upload archive from CLAUDE.md §8 — `cd dist && zip -r ../site.zip .`. It is a
# repacked copy of `dist/`, which is itself ignored two lines up, so tracking it would put
# a 400KB binary in the history on every deploy that carries no information the source does
# not already carry. Regenerate it, never fetch it from a commit.
site.zip
